api Example shop  https://shop.example/api
request  what the customer typed

read find_items  GET /items
  Find items in the catalogue by part of their name
  name    str  which item, by name
  limit?  int  how many items to show
  yes do you have any blue mugs
  no  cancel the blue mug order

read find_orders  GET /orders
  List a customer's orders, newest first
  since?  date  how far back to look
  yes what did I order last month
  no  cancel my last order

change move_delivery  PATCH /orders/{order}/delivery
  Change the day an order is delivered
  order  ref:find_orders  which order's delivery changes
  day    date             which day the order should arrive instead
  yes can my order come on Friday instead
  no  where is my order

change cancel_order  POST /orders/{order}/cancel
  Cancel one order and refund the customer
  order   ref:find_orders                which order to cancel
  reason  one:changed_mind|damaged|late  why the order is being cancelled
  yes cancel my last order, it arrived broken
  no  where is my order
